          "title": "9天搭建一座云冈石窟",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122606.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122607.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>山西云冈石窟研究院用9天时间，在上海宝龙美术馆搭建了一个 3D 打印的云岗石窟。</p>",
