          "title": "世界保存最好的恐龙化石",
          "content": "<p>2017年，加拿大发现了一具恐龙化石，距今1.1亿年，保存之完好令人震惊。皮肤、鳞甲、内脏都是完整的，实际上是恐龙木乃伊，而不是化石。它是怎么形成的，仍然是一个谜。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202005/bg2020052304.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202005/bg2020052305.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202005/bg2020052306.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202005/bg2020052307.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这头恐龙长5.5米，下面是它的复原图。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202005/bg2020052303.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
