        {
          "title": "纽约住宅的前门楼梯",
          "content": "<p>纽约市很多住宅楼，尤其是老住宅楼，都装有前门楼梯。这成了纽约市的一种特色。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122804.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122805.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>这是因为纽约最早是荷兰人的殖民地，早期的住宅楼都是荷兰式的。荷兰地势低洼，经常被水淹，所以住宅都修得较高，必须走楼梯进入，免得洪水淹没客厅的地板。</p>\n<p>后来的建筑师沿袭了这种风格，即使没有淹水的风险，也加高了客厅，修建了前门楼梯。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122806.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122807.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "纽约住宅的前门楼梯",
              "url": "https://ephemeralnewyork.wordpress.com/2020/12/07/how-new-york-became-a-metropolis-of-stoops/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122804.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122805.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122806.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202012/bg2020122807.jpg"
          ]
        }
      ]
